```

### Verification

- Use an online contrast checker (e.g., [WebAIM Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/contrast/)) to verify that all text meets WCAG 2.1 AA or AAA contrast ratios.
- Test with assistive technologies (screen readers may not rely on color contrast, but visual clarity is important for all users).

### Summary

- **Problem:** Insufficient color contrast between text and background, failing WCAG 2.1 AAA contrast requirements.
- **Fix:** Increase the contrast by darkening the foreground text colors or lightening the background.
- **Result:** Improved readability for visually impaired users without affecting the layout or design for users without impairments.

