## **Additional Recommendations**
- **Test with Color Contrast Tools:** Use [WebAIM Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/contrast/) to verify all color combinations.
- **Use Semantic Colors:** Choose colors that are meaningful and consistent (e.g., blue for links, green for buttons).
